    "title": "Glenn Haygood to retire from Hearst's WLKY - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matthew Keys ,\n1 days ago Hearst Television says Glenn Haygood, the company’s President and General Manager of WKLY-TV in Louisville, Kentucky, will retire later this year, capping a broadcast TV career that spans more than four decades. Haygood has led WLKY (Channel 32, CBS) since 2008, overseeing both its editorial and business operations during... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
